    <p>
      This page is marked <span class="badge badge--amber">August 2026 updated</span>. The statutory
      duty/VAT rates and the Mirsal 2 pre-arrival rule are re-checked against the FTA and Dubai
      Customs; the sea and air transit windows are market snapshots re-checked monthly because
      sailing frequency, congestion and season change them.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a carrier publishes a fixed schedule, a terminal publishes current discharge times, or
